---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_IMAGES } from '../data/images';
const title = 'Star Wars Galactic Racer Guide: Campaign, Vehicles and Race Practice';
const description = 'An independent Galactic Racer guide to campaign decisions, vehicle classes, Arcade practice, online Tours and PC troubleshooting for the released game.';
const routes = [
 ['/game-overview/','Buying and game overview','Platforms, editions, review decisions and completion expectations.'],
 ['/game-modes/','Choose a mode','Campaign, Arcade, Scenarios and online sessions serve different goals.'],
 ['/tips/galactic-racer-first-tour-plan/','Prepare the first campaign Tour','Read the objective, inspect the craft and plan the next commitment.'],
 ['/vehicles/','Vehicle classes','Compare the three speeder classes and the separate podracer grid.'],
 ['/tracks/','Track practice','Read layouts, hazards and traffic without unsupported lap-time claims.'],
 ['/six-player-tour-race-plan/','Play with friends','Organize an online party and distinguish party size from race size.'],
 ['/pc-requirements/','PC requirements and diagnosis','Separate driver warnings, shader rebuilding, stutter and display issues.'],
 ['/tips/','Focused racing problems','Contact, drafting, boost decisions, contracts and recovery.'],
];
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} schemaType="home">
 <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-void-800">
  <img src={SITE_IMAGES.heroBanner.src} alt={SITE_IMAGES.heroBanner.alt} width={SITE_IMAGES.heroBanner.width} height={SITE_IMAGES.heroBanner.height} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="w-full object-cover" />
  <div class="p-6 md:p-10">
   <p class="text-sm text-plasma">Available now · Released October 6, 2026</p>
   <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-void-100">Star Wars Galactic Racer: Make the Next Race a Clearer Decision</h1>
   <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-void-300">Prepare a campaign run, learn a craft, practice one difficult section or get an online group ready. Start with the problem you want to solve, then use the focused guide for that task.</p>
   <a class="mt-5 inline-block rounded bg-plasma px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-void-950" href="/guide/">Browse the guide directory</a>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Choose your next step</h2><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">{routes.map(([href,label,detail]) => <li class="rounded-xl border border-void-800 p-5"><a href={href} class="text-lg font-semibold text-plasma hover:underline">{label}</a><p class="mt-2 text-void-300">{detail}</p></li>)}</ul></section>
 <section class="prose prose-invert mt-10 max-w-3xl">
  <h2>What kind of racer is this?</h2>
  <p>Galactic Racer is a runs-based combat racing game developed by Fuse Games and published by Secret Mode in collaboration with Lucasfilm Games. The solo campaign follows Shade through the Galactic League, supported by engineer Hibi and opposed by champion Kestar Bool. Choosing an event commits the run to that branch. Too many crashes cause a wreck-out, with only certain perks and unlocks carried to a new attempt.</p>
  <p>Landspeeders, speeder bikes and skim speeders share a racing grid. They have different handling identities: drifting resilience, braking-linked Kinetic Burst and Knife Edge respectively. Podracers compete separately because of their size and speed. Learn the <a href="/vehicles/landspeeders/">speeder differences</a> before adopting a fastest-vehicle claim, or use the <a href="/vehicles/podracers/">podracer introduction</a> for that transition.</p>
  <h2>Practice before adding stakes</h2>
  <p>Arcade offers time trials and precision challenges; Scenarios provide specified goals. Use a suitable practice event to isolate a bend, landing or input before committing to another campaign choice. The <a href="/tips/galactic-racer-arcade-practice-guide/">Arcade guide</a> helps organize an attempt without substituting a guessed gold time for the target displayed in your game.</p>
  <p>Backers provide the League Token needed for a Tour and ask for contracts. Rivalries can put a Token at stake. Read the <a href="/tips/league-token-and-backers/">contract decision guide</a> and the <a href="/tips/choose-your-rival/">rivalry preparation guide</a> as separate questions. A recognizable character does not make either decision automatically safe.</p>
  <h2>Buying and technical questions</h2>
  <p>The game is released on PC, PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. Storefront ownership, subscription access and cross-platform multiplayer are different matters. The <a href="/game-overview/">buying guide</a> explains the editions and records its price-check date. Confirm your platform and checkout amount before paying.</p>
  <p>On PC, check the published requirements before changing graphics options. If the game hitches, use the <a href="/pc-requirements/">diagnostic order</a>; if steering is uncomfortable, use the <a href="/keyboard-preset-driving-practice/">control guide</a>. A technical interruption and a missed racing line need different evidence.</p>
 </section>
</Layout>
